## description of what was run, for what purpose
Modal A100 performance check (with warmup) comparing flash-attn2 vs SDPA using unified attention dispatcher (torch 2.5.1+cu121, flash-attn 2.8.3 cp310) via modal_attention_flash_ampere.py::perf after adding warmup.

### command
source .venv/bin/activate && cd unsloth && modal run modal_attention_flash_ampere.py::perf

### output
